---
name: e2e-test-on-deployment
description: Run end-to-end tests after deployment changes
trigger:
  on_file_change:
    patterns:
      - "deployment/**/*.yaml"
      - "deployment/**/*.sh"
      - "deployment/agent-code/**"
      - "frontend/**/*.html"
      - "frontend/**/*.js"
    exclude:
      - "deployment/utils/test-*.sh"
      - "**/*.md"
---

# E2E Test Hook

This hook runs end-to-end tests when deployment-related files change.

## Trigger Conditions
- CloudFormation templates modified
- Deployment scripts changed
- Agent code updated
- Frontend files modified

## Actions
1. Prompt user to confirm deployment
2. Run E2E test script
3. Report results

---

When deployment files are modified, I should:

1. Ask: "Deployment files changed. Run E2E tests?"
2. If yes, execute: `./deployment/utils/test-e2e.sh`
3. Report pass/fail status
4. If failed, offer to show logs or troubleshoot
